          "final_text_tail": "apping them into `{\"tool_calls\": [dict]}`.\n   - Handles bare lists of tool-call dicts by wrapping them into `{\"tool_calls\": [...]}`.\n   - Preserves existing canonical formats with an outer `\"tool_calls\"` key.\n   - Handles JSON strings by parsing them and delegating normalization; unparseable strings are returned unchanged.\n\n2. **Task 2: Deterministic Parse Fingerprinting for `ToolCalls`**\n   - Implemented `_canonicalize_tool_args` to recursively sort dict keys, convert tuples to lists, trim string whitespace, and preserve boolean and numeric types.\n   - Implemented `_compute_tool_call_fingerprint` to serialize `{\"name\": name, \"args\": canonical_args}` using `json.dumps(..., sort_keys=True, separators=(\",\", \":\"))` and hash with SHA-256.\n   - Added `fingerprint: str` (64-hex char SHA-256) and `id: str` (first 8 hex chars) fields to [`ToolCalls.ToolCall`](file:///private/var/folders/3q/2m8v425s7p39t7qxjp0kcdw80000gn/T/parbench-host-41jzuog_/repo/dspy/adapters/types/tool.py#L279-L297).\n   - Fingerprint and id are computed at initialization time and enforced as read-only attributes.\n\n3. **Tests**\n   - Added unit tests to [`tests/adapters/test_tool.py`](file:///private/var/folders/3q/2m8v425s7p39t7qxjp0kcdw80000gn/T/parbench-host-41jzuog_/repo/tests/adapters/test_tool.py#L462-L547) verifying normalization of all input variations (dict, list, canonical dict, JSON string, unparseable string) and deterministic fingerprinting / read-only attributes.\n   - All adapter test suites passed.\n",
